{"code":"ro-RO","name":"Romanian","native":"Română","badge":"RO","tts":"ro-RO","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Nu înțeleg.","say":"noo un-tseh-LEG","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Nu știu.","say":"noo SHTEE-oo","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"O clipă, vă rog.","say":"oh KLEE-puh, vuh ROG","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Puteți repeta?","say":"poo-TETS reh-peh-TA","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Mai încet, vă rog.","say":"my un-CHET, vuh ROG","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Cum se spune „…” în română?","say":"koom seh SPOO-neh … un roh-MUH-nuh","en":"How do you say “…” in Romanian?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Sigur.","say":"SEE-goor","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Exact.","say":"eg-ZAKT","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Cred că da.","say":"kred kuh DA","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Serios?","say":"seh-ree-OS","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Nicio problemă.","say":"NEE-choh proh-BLEH-muh","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Super!","say":"SOO-per","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Unde este {x}?","say":"OON-deh YES-teh {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Aș vrea {x}.","say":"ash VRYA {x}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Aveți {x}?","say":"a-VETS {x}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x}, vă rog.","say":"{x}, vuh ROG","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Trebuie să {x}.","say":"TREH-boo-yeh suh {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Pot să {x}?","say":"pot suh {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Verific.","say":"veh-REE-fik","en":"I’ll check.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Am o ședință.","say":"am oh sheh-DEEN-tsuh","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"E picant?","say":"yeh pee-KANT","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Fără ceapă, vă rog.","say":"FUH-ruh CHYA-puh, vuh ROG","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Ce îmi recomandați?","say":"cheh um reh-koh-man-DATS","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Nu mănânc carne.","say":"noo muh-NUNK KAR-neh","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Cât costă?","say":"kut KOS-tuh","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Doar mă uit.","say":"dwar muh OOYT","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Îl iau.","say":"ul YAU","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Pot plăti cu cardul?","say":"pot pluh-TEE koo KAR-dool","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"E departe?","say":"yeh deh-PAR-teh","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"La aeroport, vă rog.","say":"la a-eh-roh-PORT, vuh ROG","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"la stânga · la dreapta · drept înainte","say":"la STUN-ga · la DRYAP-ta · drept u-na-EEN-teh","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Ajutor!","say":"a-zhoo-TOR","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Nu e hârtie igienică.","say":"noo yeh hur-TEE-eh ee-jee-EH-nee-kuh","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Mi-e rău.","say":"mee-yeh RUH-oo","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Chemați o ambulanță, vă rog.","say":"keh-MATS oh am-boo-LAN-tsuh, vuh ROG","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Încântat de cunoștință.","say":"un-kun-TAT deh koo-nohsh-TEEN-tsuh","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"De unde sunteți?","say":"deh OON-deh SOON-tets","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Cu ce vă ocupați?","say":"koo cheh vuh oh-koo-PATS","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"E delicios!","say":"yeh deh-lee-CHOS","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Salut.","say":"sa-LOOT","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Bună dimineața.","say":"BOO-nuh dee-mee-NYA-tsa","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Ce mai faci?","say":"cheh my FACH","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Da. · Nu.","say":"da · noo","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Vă rog.","say":"vuh ROG","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Mulțumesc.","say":"mool-tsoo-MESK","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Scuzați.","say":"skoo-ZATS","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"La revedere.","say":"la reh-veh-DEH-reh","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"unu · doi · trei","say":"OO-noo · doy · tray","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"patru · cinci · șase","say":"PA-troo · cheench · SHA-seh","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"șapte · opt · nouă","say":"SHAP-teh · opt · NOH-wuh","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"zece · douăzeci · o sută","say":"ZEH-cheh · doh-wuh-ZECH · oh SOO-tuh","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Mărul este roșu.","say":"MUH-rool YES-teh ROH-shoo","en":"The apple is red.","note":"“the” is a suffix: măr → mărul"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Mănânc mărul.","say":"muh-NUNK MUH-rool","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"the ending says “I”"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Am mâncat mărul.","say":"am mun-KAT MUH-rool","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past: am + participle"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Vreau să mănânc mărul.","say":"vrau suh muh-NUNK MUH-rool","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"vreau să + verb = want to"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Mănânci mere?","say":"muh-NUNCH MEH-reh","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"the voice goes up"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"toaleta","say":"toh-a-LEH-ta","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"farmacia","say":"far-ma-CHEE-a","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"spitalul","say":"spee-TA-lool","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"gara","say":"GA-ra","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"aeroportul","say":"a-eh-roh-POR-tool","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"hotelul","say":"hoh-TEH-lool","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"apă","say":"A-puh","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"o cafea","say":"oh ka-FYA","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"nota","say":"NOH-ta","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"meniul","say":"meh-NEE-ool","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"o bere","say":"oh BEH-reh","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"asta","say":"AS-ta","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"o pungă","say":"oh POON-guh","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"ședința","say":"sheh-DEEN-tsa","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"fișierul","say":"fee-shee-EH-rool","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"ecranul","say":"eh-KRA-nool","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"mesajul","say":"meh-SA-zhool","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"mâine","say":"MUY-neh","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"plec","say":"plek","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"intru","say":"EEN-troo","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"plătesc","say":"pluh-TESK","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Alergie · vă rog citiți","ask":"Acest fel de mâncare conține vreunul dintre aceste ingrediente?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Mulțumesc mult!","note":"Peanuts are also called alune; alune alone usually means hazelnuts.","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Am o alergie gravă la arahide. Nu pot mânca arahide sau ulei de arahide.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Am o alergie gravă la fructe de mare (creveți, crabi, scoici).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Nu pot mânca gluten (grâu, orz, secară).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Nu mănânc carne, pui sau pește.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Nu mănânc carne de porc.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"TOALETĂ · WC","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"FEMEI · BĂRBAȚI","en":"Women · Men"},{"t":"F · B","en":"F = Femei (women), B = Bărbați (men)","warn":true},{"t":"IEȘIRE · INTRARE","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"ÎMPINGEȚI · TRAGEȚI","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"IEȘIRE DE URGENȚĂ","en":"Emergency exit"}]}